Cell["\<\
Here we see that the expected times to coalescence at the right and left loci \
are 1 regardless of the initial state.\
\>", "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.951472705546406*^9, 
  3.951472737798039*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"6e25adfd-7f7f-4bed-b910-\
